T(m,n):=if m=0 and n=1 then 1 else if m=0 and n>1 then 0 else  if m=1 then binomial(1,n-1) else sum(binomial(i,n-i)*T(m-1,i),i,1,n); /* _Vladimir Kruchinin_, May 19 2012 */

